<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
	<title>Coming Soon! | Kyanit</title>
	<meta charset="UTF-8">
	<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

	<!-- TABS --><script src="/vendor/js/tabs.js" defer></script>

	<script type="module" src="/dist/js/entries/coming-soon.entry.js" defer></script>

	<link rel="stylesheet" href="/dist/css/main.entry.css">
</head>
<body>
	<%- include('partials/header') %>

	<main>
		<h1><span class="material-symbols-outlined">upcoming</span> Coming Soon!</h1>

		<p>This page is coming soon! Hopefully this will be up as soon as possible. <em>Let me cook 🔥</em>. Meanwhile you wait, you could play with these buttons 😁.</p>

		<p><button id="test-alert"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">add_alert</span> Alert</button></p>
		<p>
			<button id="test-confirm"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">approval_delegation</span> Confirm</button>
			<button id="test-destructive-confirm" class="destructive"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">explosion</span> Destructive confirm</button>
		</p>
		<p><button id="test-form"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">forms_add_on</span> Form</button></p>
		<p><button id="test-toast" class="secondary"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">toast</span> Toast</button></p>

		<div class="tabs" role="tablist">
			<button class="tab tab-active" id="first-tab" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="first-panel" role="tab" tabindex="0">First</button>
			<button class="tab" id="second-tab" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="second-panel" role="tab" tabindex="1">Second</button>
		</div>

		<section class="panel" id="first-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="first-tab">
			<p>This is tab 1.</p>

			<div class="accordion">
			<details>
				<summary>
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined chevron">chevron_right</span>
					Where does the name Kyanit comes from?
				</summary>
				<div class="accordion-details">
					<p>Kyanit comes from the crystal kyanite.</p>
				</div>
			</details>
			<details open>
				<summary>
					<span class="material-symbols-outlined chevron">chevron_right</span>
					This is an accordion
				</summary>

				<div class="accordion-details">
					<p>It is frequently used for FAQs.</p>
				</div>
			</details>
		</div>
		</section>
		<section class="panel" id="second-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="second-tab" hidden>
			<p>But this is tab 2.</p>
		</section>
	</main>
</body>
</html>